{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act19side_level_act19side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act19side",
  "stageId": "act19side_06",
  "title": "挣脱美梦",
  "storyCode": "DV-6",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "29a05fc6fd4adbaf983fa644f103a8b96c5ebb154b51f82744852bb250d55c12",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "巨大的机器在黑暗之中沉默着。\n交错的缆线就像蔓延的植物根茎，节点点缀着沉甸甸的苞芽。\n每一个苞芽都是一组发着微光的电极，从下方的生命体中汲取着养分。\n失踪的拓荒者们头戴电极，一个挨着一个，围躺在一起。\n他们仍在正常呼吸，可仿佛对外面发生的一切都无知无觉。\n整间实验室里最显眼的，是流淌在所有缆线里，并汇集在最中央的仪器中的银色液体。\n比起神态奇异的几十名受试者，它才像是真正“活着”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么会这样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......海伦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "为什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "text": "迪克，盖尔，索菲亚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "text": "所有人都在这里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "text": "放了他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "text": "请小声些，好不好？我们会吓到他们的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "text": "抱歉，再等一等......等我解决眼前的小问题。一定会没事的，朋友们，我保证。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "text": "......你在对他们说话？他们恐怕听不见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "text": "这样的生命体征，我只在昏迷的乔伊丝身上见过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "text": "这些电极和银色液体......说不定正连接着他们的中枢神经系统。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "text": "多萝西，为什么......海伦也在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "text": "她担心自己无法通过斐尔迪南的考核，于是我为她提供了一个建议。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "text": "建议......是指让她也变成受试者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "text": "海伦早上还在和我们说笑，现在却像根木头似的躺在这里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "text": "我想救她，埃琳娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "text": "我能感受到，她有多么痛苦......就像我能感受到他们所有人的痛苦一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "text": "海伦的贷款几乎拖垮了他们一整个家庭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "text": "她每天都生活在恐慌中......假如斐尔迪南真的将她开除的话，她甚至会考虑结束自己的生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "text": "要是......我在这里停下，他们只能回到最悲惨的命运之路上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "text": "我怎么忍心做这么残忍的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "text": "......停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "text": "停下你这些自以为是的发言，否则的话，我真的不保证自己不会在下一秒就射穿你的脑袋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "text": "桑尼，你对我的愤恨，来自于你对眼前事物和对我的不理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "text": "可我理解你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "text": "荒谬！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "text": "你理解我们，所以准备“恩赐”给我们一些新的机会，让我们除了死在天灾下、死在野兽口中之外，再多一条路——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "text": "在大公司的实验室变成一具具勉强活着的尸体？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "text": "多么慷慨的提议！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "text": "你自己难道就没有想过吗，桑尼？为什么......为什么一样是得了矿石病，有的人还能继续工作，有的人却只能背井离乡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "text": "不用你告诉我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "text": "在医院给出诊断之后的第二天，我就同时收到了保险合同和解雇通知书。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "text": "保险合同有五百六十九页，解雇通知书却只有薄薄半张纸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "text": "很少有公司愿意雇佣一名感染者，除非这名感染者能证明自己值得公司为他支付这笔巨额保险费——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "text": "你难道不觉得......这是多么不公平？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "text": "......这还用说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "text": "那你也该理解我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "text": "......联系不上赫默和格雷伊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "text": "基地恐怕完全被封闭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "斐尔......迪南。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "封闭实验室只会是手段，而不是目的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "接下来斐尔迪南会在359号基地有大动作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "text": "博士，赫默他们会有危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "text": "我们收不到任何基地内的信息......是否立刻支援？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "白面鸮......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......九号装置。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "九号装置的数据传输的确不同于正常通讯......只要信号有一瞬间的恢复，我们就能看到白面鸮看到的东西。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "博士，我这就试着同步白面鸮。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "......弗兰克斯女士，您确定您要独自一个人去见他？\n是的，我拿到了管理局的许可。\n我听说那个叫洛肯·威廉姆斯的人是个疯子，拿人体做很残酷的实验，被判了一百多年。\n我知道，我以前听过他的讲座。\n这些科学家是不是都挺疯的？咳咳，抱歉，我忘了您也是......像您这样温柔端庄的女士，一定跟他们都不一样。\n我明白，您只是想提醒我注意安全。我会小心的，谢谢。\n您预计会在里面逗留多久？\n一个小时。有必要的话，我下周同一时间还会再过来一趟。\n你有这么多想跟他聊的？他可不怎么理会其他人啊......\n也许......是因为别人都是想向他索取什么。而我......我想请求他帮我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "所有人都该获得平等的机会，天赋的差异不该决定任何人的人生走向。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "当任何有天赋的人因为自己的天赋获得特权的时候，他都在结果上侵占了其他人的利益，破坏了公平。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "我就是那个既得利益者，我为自己的“幸运”而羞愧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "在这里的每一个人......迪克，海伦，还有你，桑尼，我只是想在泥水将你们吞没之前......拉住你们。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "我所做的一切努力，都是希望有一天......幸运只青睐足够努力的人，而不再偏袒所谓的天赋者。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "这么多年来，我一直在尝试。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "改造个体，来让他们变得更强大，并不能解决问题。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "天生强大的人，也能通过改造来变得更强，他们甚至还能抢占先机，在新的赛道上拉出更大的鸿沟。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "想要真正的平等，我只能......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "......你想抹除个体的差距？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "失去意识的受试者......有情绪反应的源石技艺造物......这巨大的将他们连接在一起的仪器......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "你......你在做的实验是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "我听说过类似的实验，但我还以为这是早已失败的狂想......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "......狂想？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "没有哪一种技术本身是“疯狂”的，技术只是实现不同理想的手段。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "个体的差距与生俱来，我们不必忽视或者忘记它，但也不必一生受它所累。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "通过我的技术，人们将能更平等地感受彼此，也将更平等地感受土地、空气与雨水。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "险隘将无法阻挡步伐，风暴也将不再遮蔽视线。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "不必忍受跋涉之苦，不必与骨肉至亲分离，人们就能更安全地眺望远方。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "你们难道看不见......这样的未来有多美好？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "......我是不是从来都没有真的搞明白过？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "这究竟是个什么实验啊......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "埃琳娜，我们一直在找银色造物背后的施术者。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "直到刚才，我们都以为是这一个个拓荒者，其实并不是。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "施术者是他们全部。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "......你有一双非常敏锐的眼睛，赫默医生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "弗兰克斯主任，你所描绘的未来只是......你的想象。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "而我看到的......我看到的是另一番景象。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "一个源石技艺卓越的术师就能轻松摧毁一栋楼，三个卓越的术师能感知并控制一整个街区——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "那把几十个、上百个乃至上千个人的力量融合起来呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "大地上的每一个角落都将逃不脱它的“注视”，再坚固的堡垒也不过是它随手就能捏碎的玩具。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "而你所关心的这些人，你口中的朋友，他们在想要利用这技术的人眼中，永远都只是实验品。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "那些失败的......失败的可能还好一些。那些人对失败品没兴趣，愿意放任他们自生自灭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "成功的“幸运儿”才是最不幸的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "从实验成功的那一天起，他们就只能活在企业和政府的监控下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "奥利维亚......我从来没见过你这样......"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "这样愤怒。\n赫默感觉到了自己的怒火，她的大脑嗡嗡作响，过往的一幕幕接二连三地浮现出来，将理性与修养撞得七零八落。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "你确实会改变他们的命运，可代价呢？他们会永远失去自由，也失去自己的人生！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "......我会保护他们。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "我愿意付出我的生命......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "也许在这里杀了你，对所有人而言才是最安全的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "如果这是你们的最终决定......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "我不会反抗。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "桑尼，千万别冲动！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "哈哈......乌比卡博士，我没有冲动。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "我比任何时候都要清醒。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "多萝西·弗兰克斯......我必须承认，你描绘的未来很有吸引力。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "就像我差一点点就走进了你的实验室......也许连你都不知道，我有多少次想拉住你的手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "......为什么不？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "因为我的未来......应该是自己的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "你的言语，你的姿态......越让我想要亲近，我就越清醒地意识到......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "你正在控制我们。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "我......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "要挣脱一个美梦......比挣脱噩梦更难。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "弗兰克斯主任，也许你也正在这个梦中，可我们要面对的却是真正的现实。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "赫默医生是对的，这样的实验，从头到尾都不该存在。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "这片土地已经孕育出了足够的疯狂，像这样疯狂的主意，还是尽早埋葬更好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "即便我们全都要死在这里......即便我要承担最惨痛的后果。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "我也希望类似的事情到此为止。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "奥利维亚，快劝劝桑尼呀！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "无论如何......多萝西是想帮助这些受试者。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "就算......就算她应该被阻止，应该受到惩罚，也不该这样......不该由这些她真心爱着的人......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白面鸮",
          "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
          "text": "桑尼......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "乔伊丝？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "你......清醒了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白面鸮",
          "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
          "text": "请不要伤害弗兰克斯主任。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "博士，同步失败。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "......359号基地里实验的情况说不定比我们预想的还要严峻。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
          "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
          "text": "嗯......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你还好吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
          "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
          "text": "谢谢你扶着我，Dr.{@nickname}。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
          "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
          "text": "我终于能感觉到自己的腿了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "359号基地背后不止有莱茵生命。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "斐尔迪南与其他更大的势力有合作。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
          "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
          "text": "斐尔迪南的合作对象，塞雷娅也很清楚吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
          "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
          "text": "你追踪了那么久的动力甲，最后只可能穿在最需要尖端武器的那些人身上。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "你见过那些人了，证据呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
          "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
          "text": "......这就给你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
          "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
          "text": "刚才的温柔果然是错觉吧？为了搞到你想要的证据，我可是差点连命都搭上啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "我们一直以来的猜测都是真的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "斐尔迪南已经不再隐藏自己的野心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "斐尔迪南想要用这个实验来换取支持......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
          "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
          "text": "......然后夺取莱茵生命。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
          "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
          "text": "我们必须去找克丽斯腾，她才是斐尔迪南的第一目标。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
          "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
          "text": "塞雷娅，你收到我发的最后一条消息了吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "......我联系了莱茵的线人，他们说内部一切如常。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
          "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
          "text": "那是因为他们早就习惯了总辖不露面。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
          "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
          "text": "斐尔迪南筹谋了好几年，一点点架空了总辖......这个实验换来的筹码将是最后一步。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
          "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
          "text": "唔，搞不好不是最后一步。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
          "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
          "text": "在被抓住之前，我已经有一个多星期联系不上克丽斯腾了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "那基地那边怎么办？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
          "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
          "text": "我相信赫默医生的能力，她可是让我吃过亏的人呢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
          "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
          "text": "来不及犹豫了哦，塞雷娅。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
          "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
          "text": "你必须做出选择。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "......博士，这并不是一个选择题。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "解决基地问题的前提是解决斐尔迪南，而解决斐尔迪南的方式正摆在我们面前。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "走吧，去见一见莱茵总辖。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
